{"title":"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Arithmetic_mean\" title=\"Arithmetic mean\">arithmetic mean</a> of two <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Number\" title=\"Number\">numbers</a> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and their <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Geometric_mean\" title=\"Geometric mean\">geometric mean</a> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, then an <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Equation\" title=\"Equation\">equation</a> with the given two numbers as <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Root\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Root\">roots</a> is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/3/293d714713df8846d8ef2884baae420d006d909e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)} \\ x^2 + 12x + 100 = 0 ~~ \\text{(B)} \\ x^2 + 6x + 100 = 0 ~~ \\text{(C)} \\ x^2 - 12x - 10 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"549\" height=\"19\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/c/cfc904cf986fb95f51e67da31036466ba2eb6f21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(D)} \\ x^2 - 12x + 100 = 0 \\qquad \\text{(E)} \\ x^2 - 6x + 100 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"387\" height=\"19\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let the numbers be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/a/03a45952f8115322d2879f7d090126f059757ba0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\eta$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"9\" height=\"11\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/a/fda38f45a64bbd4451aedeeb4584e01d91239172.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\zeta$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/e/afe6533bbea01adc1130bcd5c72896bb8a28d5a5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\dfrac{\\eta+\\zeta}{2}=6\\Rightarrow \\eta+\\zeta=12\\]\" width=\"188\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/7/de7a4ce3688ec5ffd545921a25adf78c83084bae.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sqrt{\\eta\\zeta}=10\\Rightarrow \\eta\\zeta=100\\]\" width=\"175\" height=\"22\" />.\n</p><p>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Monic_polynomial\" title=\"Monic polynomial\">monic</a> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Quadratic\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Quadratic\">quadratic</a> with roots <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/a/03a45952f8115322d2879f7d090126f059757ba0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\eta$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"9\" height=\"11\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/a/fda38f45a64bbd4451aedeeb4584e01d91239172.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\zeta$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"18\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/4/fe4b16b6ef7782891306e5299a2bee488b0d8508.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2-(\\eta+\\zeta)x+\\eta\\zeta$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"146\" height=\"19\" />. Therefore, an equation with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/a/03a45952f8115322d2879f7d090126f059757ba0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\eta$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"9\" height=\"11\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/a/fda38f45a64bbd4451aedeeb4584e01d91239172.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\zeta$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"18\" /> as roots is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/4/b448ac594357dcb6e9063156e5e949deb1cdb052.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 - 12x + 100 = 0\\Rightarrow \\text{(D)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"203\" height=\"19\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME\" title=\"1966 AHSME\">1966 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1966 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1966\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"t